  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "10.6.0\n- First release. The UI components (ErrorMessageBanner, PageProgress, LoadingProgress, DataPager, ModelDataPager, SortableHeader, BlazorToolkitPageLayout) moved here from DevInstance.BlazorToolkit 10.5.x. The namespace (DevInstance.BlazorToolkit.Components) is unchanged; ServiceExecutionHostComponent stays in the core package.\n- Depends on DevInstance.BlazorToolkit with the same version; both packages are released together.\n- Fixed: SortableHeader's label link pointed to the literal URL \"SortLink\" when UrlTemplate was set.\nSee https://github.com/devInstance/BlazorToolkit/blob/master/docs/USAGE.md#ui-components",
